prefix_rule(pattern=["/bin/zsh", "-lc", "engram save \"Found duplicate verdict row in PR-7143 review\" $'**What**: PR-7143-REVIEW-VERDICT.md claims 21 comments and 16 TRUE, but its summary table lists comment 3687165262 twice, producing 22 rows.\\n**Why**: User asked to inspect the verdict file; this is an internal consistency issue in the document.\\n**Where**: /Users/sebabreguel/vambe/toreto/PR-7143-REVIEW-VERDICT.md\\n**Learned**: The detailed sections contain the issue once; the duplicate exists only in the summary table.' --type discovery --project toreto --scope project"], decision="allow")
